@startuml
skinparam style strictuml
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

actor "Пользователь" as User
participant "NoteSearchBar:\nUI" as UI
participant "ComposeTextState:\nState" as State
participant "DrawerActions:\nActions" as Actions
participant "GetNotesUseCase:\nUseCase" as GetNotesUseCase
participant "AndroidProjectRepository:\nRepository" as Repo
participant "NoteDao:\nRoom DB" as DB

User -> UI : Ввод символа в поле поиска
activate UI

UI -> State : Обновление TextFieldState
activate State
State --> UI : Обновление TextField
deactivate State

note over Actions : snapshotFlow обнаруживает\nизменение searchState.text

Actions -> GetNotesUseCase : invoke(project, queryStr)
activate Actions
activate GetNotesUseCase

GetNotesUseCase -> GetNotesUseCase : SearchQuery.parse(queryStr)\n(разбор тегов, имен, текста)

GetNotesUseCase -> Repo : getNotesPaged(project, parsedQuery)
activate Repo

Repo -> Repo : buildSQLiteQuery()\n(генерация SQL с FTS/LIKE)

Repo -> DB : searchNotesPaged(sqlQuery)
activate DB
DB --> Repo : Flow<PagingData<NoteEntity>>
deactivate DB

Repo --> GetNotesUseCase : Flow<PagingData<Note>>
deactivate Repo

GetNotesUseCase --> Actions : Flow<PagingData<Note>>
deactivate GetNotesUseCase

Actions --> UI : Эмиссия новых данных\n(collectAsLazyPagingItems)
deactivate Actions

UI -> UI : Обновление списка в LazyColumn

@enduml